  "reflectionText": "Two disciples walked seven miles from Jerusalem to Emmaus with grief in their words, and a stranger drew near and went with them. Their eyes were kept from knowing him. What is it to walk a long road in mourning, beside the One you were mourning, and not to know him until the bread was broken in the afternoon?",
